<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro can helps you to loot really really faster than the normal, just ONE click and your looting sooo fast ON DEADBOX.

It can be used to as an average recoil macro for smg like r99, flatine, r301, etc ...

Enjoy :)
</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 1 1
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 1 -1
Delay 10 ms
MoveR -1 -1
Delay 10 ms
MoveR -1 1
Delay 10 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>